<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="et">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="data:image/png;base64,">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="data:image/png;base64,">
    <meta name="description" content="RIA DigiDoc rakendust ei leitud või vajab uuendamist. Paigalda või uuenda rakendus App Store'ist või Google Play poest.">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">
    <title>RIA DigiDoc rakendust ei leitud – id.eesti.ee</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Roboto", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            background: #fff;
            color: #003168;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        a:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #005fcc;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1268px;
            margin-inline: auto;
            padding-inline: 24px;
        }

        /* Header */
        .site-header {
            background: #fff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .site-header .container {
            height: 80px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .site-header .logo svg {
            display: block;
            height: 40px;
            width: auto;
        }

        .lang-link {
            color: #003168;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .lang-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Hero */
        .hero {
            background: #003168;
            color: #fff;
            padding-block: 32px;
        }

        .hero .container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: stretch;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 48px;
        }

        .hero-intro {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 32px;
            max-width: 546px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 44px;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 56px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .hero-intro p {
            max-width: 512px;
            margin-top: 16px;
        }

        /* Store badges */
        .store-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .store-links a {
            display: block;
            line-height: 0;
            width: 189px;
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .store-links svg {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }

        @media (min-width: 480px) {
            .store-links a {
                width: auto;
            }

            .store-links svg {
                width: auto;
                height: 56px;
            }
        }

        @media (forced-colors: active) {
            .store-links a {
                border: 2px solid LinkText;
            }
        }

        /* Steps card */
        .steps-card {
            background: #fff;
            color: #003168;
            width: 571px;
            max-width: 100%;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            padding: 32px;
            border-radius: 16px 16px 100px 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 13px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 8px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .steps-card h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 28px;
        }

        .steps {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
            counter-reset: step;
        }

        .steps li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
            counter-increment: step;
        }

        .steps li::before {
            content: counter(step);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #c63d1a;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* Articles */
        .articles {
            padding-block: 56px;
        }

        .articles-panel {
            background: #f0faff;
            border-radius: 16px 100px 16px 16px;
            padding: 64px 24px;
        }

        .articles-panel h2 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 300;
            line-height: 42px;
        }

        .article-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 32px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .article-list li {
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        .article-list a {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            margin-inline: -12px;
            padding: 20px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #003168;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .article-list a:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 49, 104, 0.05);
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .article-list svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .site-footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            background: #fff;
            padding-block: 16px;
        }

        .site-footer .container {
            max-width: 1228px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 24px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .site-footer .footer-logo svg {
            display: block;
            width: 173px;
            height: 47px;
        }

        .footer-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            color: #c63d1a;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .footer-link svg {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 1023px) {
            .hero .container {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch;
            }

            .hero-intro {
                max-width: none;
            }

            .steps-card {
                width: 100%;
                padding-inline: 24px;
            }

            .articles {
                padding-block: 48px;
            }

            .articles-panel {
                padding-inline: 16px;
            }

            .site-footer {
                padding-block: 32px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="display: none" aria-hidden="true">
    <symbol id="icon-external" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
        <path d="M12.6667 12.6667H3.33333V3.33333H8V2H3.33333C2.59333 2 2 2.6 2 3.33333V12.6667C2 13.4 2.59333 14 3.33333 14H12.6667C13.4 14 14 13.4 14 12.6667V8H12.6667V12.6667ZM9.33333 2V3.33333H11.7267L5.17333 9.88667L6.11333 10.8267L12.6667 4.27333V6.66667H14V2H9.33333Z" fill="currentColor"/>
    </symbol>
</svg>
<header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
        <a class="logo" href="https://www.id.ee/" aria-label="id.ee avaleht" data-i18n-aria="logoAria">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 80 60" width="53" height="40" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.125" y="1.125" width="77.75" height="57.75" rx="5.875" fill="#fff" stroke="#003168" stroke-width="2.25"/><path fill="#f04e22" d="M11 9h13v10l-13 5Z"/><path fill="#003168" d="M24.125 23.65 11 28.9v22.225h13.125Z"/><path fill="#003168" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M29 9h23c11.5 0 19 8.5 19 21s-7.5 21-19 21H29Zm13 11v20h7c5.5 0 9-4 9-10s-3.5-10-9-10Z"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a class="lang-link" id="lang-toggle" href="?lang=en" lang="en" hreflang="en">English</a>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="hero-intro">
                <div>
                    <h1 data-i18n="heading">RIA DigiDoc rakendust ei leitud või vajab uuendamist</h1>
                    <p data-i18n="intro">Valisid e-teenuses autentimiseks või allkirjastamiseks ID-kaardi NFC lahenduse, kuid sinu
                        seadmes ei leitud RIA DigiDoc mobiilirakendust või see vajab uuendamist. Toimingu
                        lõpuleviimiseks paigalda või uuenda rakendus ja alusta seejärel uuesti.</p>
                </div>
                <nav aria-label="Rakenduse allalaadimine" data-i18n-aria="storeNavAria" class="store-links">
